    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1487710/extras/602806513ffe6aad21fadc9e5dbc7fd8.poster.avif?t=1720436981\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1487710/extras/602806513ffe6aad21fadc9e5dbc7fd8.webm?t=1720436981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1487710/extras/602806513ffe6aad21fadc9e5dbc7fd8.mp4?t=1720436981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br>Rite of Titans is a Free to Play hero-centric 3v3 action game - currently in the alpha stage. Master the moves and outplay your rivals in an epic, fast-paced hybrid of arcade sports and ability-based competition. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1487710/extras/f6363fce790ebfde369acf691d392c49.poster.avif?t=1720436981\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1487710/extras/f6363fce790ebfde369acf691d392c49.webm?t=1720436981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1487710/extras/f6363fce790ebfde369acf691d392c49.mp4?t=1720436981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Hone your own skills through solo matchmaking or build a team with your Steam friends to strategize and outflank your opponents.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1487710/extras/6fa5702d656d49e1fd42533000fe656a.poster.avif?t=1720436981\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1487710/extras/6fa5702d656d49e1fd42533000fe656a.webm?t=1720436981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1487710/extras/6fa5702d656d49e1fd42533000fe656a.mp4?t=1720436981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Score 10 points or get the highest score within 5 minutes to win. Draws trigger a deathmatch where the first team to score claims victory. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1487710/extras/94ae9f1acb72c8e8dc4f94b32969f3e6.poster.avif?t=1720436981\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1487710/extras/94ae9f1acb72c8e8dc4f94b32969f3e6.webm?t=1720436981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1487710/extras/94ae9f1acb72c8e8dc4f94b32969f3e6.mp4?t=1720436981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Are you a Defender, Midfielder, or Striker? Pick a specialty and make the best of your hero's unique abilities. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1487710/extras/a45e079c13ef91b8504f3774f6d25b0f.poster.avif?t=1720436981\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1487710/extras/a45e079c13ef91b8504f3774f6d25b0f.webm?t=1720436981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1487710/extras/a45e079c13ef91b8504f3774f6d25b0f.mp4?t=1720436981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Enter unique arenas, conquer diverse challenges. Each offers distinct play styles and opportunities. Adapt, strategize, triumph!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1487710/extras/20c13fa5806eda60845265f9f033bff9.poster.avif?t=1720436981\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1487710/extras/20c13fa5806eda60845265f9f033bff9.webm?t=1720436981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1487710/extras/20c13fa5806eda60845265f9f033bff9.mp4?t=1720436981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>No Pay-to-Win here: only your skill can make a difference. Want to support us? We'll have a treasure trove of skins and other cosmetics for you to choose from. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1487710/extras/0cbc857042ca0f4ce2dc9d466fa70388.avif?t=1720436981\" /></div><br><br>Shape the game by joining early and sharing your feedback with the team. Wishlist to join Early Access, or apply to playtest our pre-alpha build now. <br><br>Features we have currently planned (please keep in mind that this is not necessarily the order in which they will be added to the game, as your feedback will have a large impact on our priorities):<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>brand new arena maps<br></li><li>new heroes with new playstyles<br></li><li>full equipment and an inventory system<br></li><li>player accounts and a progression system<br></li><li>skins and consumables<br></li><li>custom rooms for custom gameplay</li></ul><br>The team also are looking to release on Consoles, but this will only be considered after we leave Early Access. Our current focus is to make a kickass PC game.<br><br>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1487710/extras/602806513ffe6aad21fadc9e5dbc7fd8.poster.avif?t=1720436981\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1487710/extras/602806513ffe6aad21fadc9e5dbc7fd8.webm?t=1720436981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1487710/extras/602806513ffe6aad21fadc9e5dbc7fd8.mp4?t=1720436981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br>Rite of Titans is a Free to Play hero-centric 3v3 action game - currently in the alpha stage. Master the moves and outplay your rivals in an epic, fast-paced hybrid of arcade sports and ability-based competition. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1487710/extras/f6363fce790ebfde369acf691d392c49.poster.avif?t=1720436981\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1487710/extras/f6363fce790ebfde369acf691d392c49.webm?t=1720436981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1487710/extras/f6363fce790ebfde369acf691d392c49.mp4?t=1720436981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Hone your own skills through solo matchmaking or build a team with your Steam friends to strategize and outflank your opponents.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1487710/extras/6fa5702d656d49e1fd42533000fe656a.poster.avif?t=1720436981\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1487710/extras/6fa5702d656d49e1fd42533000fe656a.webm?t=1720436981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1487710/extras/6fa5702d656d49e1fd42533000fe656a.mp4?t=1720436981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Score 10 points or get the highest score within 5 minutes to win. Draws trigger a deathmatch where the first team to score claims victory. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1487710/extras/94ae9f1acb72c8e8dc4f94b32969f3e6.poster.avif?t=1720436981\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1487710/extras/94ae9f1acb72c8e8dc4f94b32969f3e6.webm?t=1720436981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1487710/extras/94ae9f1acb72c8e8dc4f94b32969f3e6.mp4?t=1720436981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Are you a Defender, Midfielder, or Striker? Pick a specialty and make the best of your hero's unique abilities. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1487710/extras/a45e079c13ef91b8504f3774f6d25b0f.poster.avif?t=1720436981\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1487710/extras/a45e079c13ef91b8504f3774f6d25b0f.webm?t=1720436981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1487710/extras/a45e079c13ef91b8504f3774f6d25b0f.mp4?t=1720436981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Enter unique arenas, conquer diverse challenges. Each offers distinct play styles and opportunities. Adapt, strategize, triumph!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1487710/extras/20c13fa5806eda608452